lines+=['', '## 正しさと証明','', 'Final ./verify.sh PASS including the full timing benchmark. Independent final differential1931 comparisons/347 distinct puzzles PASS (all7 CLI commands, exact exit/stdout/stderr except BENCH timing, invalid inputs, file boundaries, deterministic seeded generation, ordered1/8/16-thread batch). Set-based solutions/clue preservation and independent Python rating trace oracle pass. Existing independent capped counter checks generated uniqueness and retained clue/pair minimality.216 CLI fixtures, forced-fuel/valid-prefix handling and mutation checks pass. Existing6060 exact search-state/fuel observations still pass; no solver algorithm/fuel change was adopted.', '', 'Indexed-rating tests compare every243 index entry to independent nine-cell scans after each action, exact NS/HS/LC/NP action order, fuel0..63/0..23 and empty-board boundary to unchanged list reference. All applicable finite laws and generic four-mode batch/sequence equality remain. Output rope needed additional String append identity/associativity and arbitrary-tail induction proofs; BendTT verdict PASS. The initial proof failure and failed old prepared-count mutant interception were retained, then fixed without removing the properties.', '', 'Native/Bend all7 commands and Node-compatible5 commands PASS. JS file IO requires Bun, which is not installed on this host; that pre-existing lane limitation remains and is explicitly reported by the suite. No permission barrier or unfinished engine correction remains.', '', '## 再現','', 'Working directory sudoku-engine-bend; local branch perf/structural-optimization. Production commits3f4730a (02), f978269 (03), a4d9e31 (08), then final evidence commit. No push/merge. See README.md for baseline rebuild and corpus restoration.', '', '```sh', '. ./toolchain-env.sh', './build.sh', './verify.sh', 'python3 qa/perf-20261001/prepare_corpus.py ../corpora', 'python3 qa/perf-20261001/differential.py --base ../baseline --candidate bin/bend-sudoku --repo . --corpora ../corpora --out /tmp/differential.json', 'python3 qa/perf-20261001/measure.py --base ../baseline --candidate bin/bend-sudoku --cases qa/perf-20261001/cases.json --corpora ../corpora --reps 21 --out /tmp/measurement.json', 'python3 qa/perf-20261003/analyze.py /tmp/measurement.json', '```', '', 'Every trial has NN-change.patch plus measurements and raw samples in results/. final-confirm.json.raw.json.gz includes wall/user/system/RSS, stdout/stderr hashes, every warmup and observation, randomized order and internal BENCH time. Final source and reports remain local.']
